    <div><h2>Meet as equals</h2><p>One hundred charity leaders and one hundred company leaders, in the same room, in equal numbers. Nobody is the audience and nobody is the pitch.</p></div>
    <div><h2>Learn from each other</h2><p>The only presentations are from the charities the room came to hear. Everything else is conversation, with the people you'd never otherwise sit next to.</p></div>
    <div><h2>Leave with allies</h2><p>The room decides which three charities go home with £2,000, £1,000 and £500. Everyone leaves with names, not leaflets.</p></div>
